40bec3ec19ddfc3e90f1c0a5d63901071c6b31bd5e3","download_count":15,"created_at":"2026-10-09T11:35:19Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T11:35:52Z"},{"id":624792562,"node_id":"RA_kwDOJx09RM4lPZPy","name":"package-community-windows-x64-windows-exe.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":420556000,"digest":"sha256:5fb57e6b0a2f5e5bd9e0843325230b757511d31eab4529398bf072719173a1bc","download_count":184,"created_at":"2026-10-09T11:35:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T11:35:49Z"},{"id":624792683,"node_id":"RA_kwDOJx09RM4lPZRr","name":"release-index.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":2437,"digest":"sha256:ce92505484debbec227ef23f51121a629aa35aebfb54ba453e2d885606f4da86","download_count":4966,"created_at":"2026-10-09T11:35:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T11:35:27Z"},{"id":624788142,"node_id":"RA_kwDOJx09RM4lPYKu","name":"SHA256SUMS","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":3101,"digest":"sha256:d4d97f4aa384adb83831cb497b68092e589bb32f1745d18bb73c9a2316489dc0","download_count":33,"created_at":"2026-10-09T11:33:24Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T11:33:24Z"}],"body":"Chat2DB Community 5.3.8 reads, copies and exports complete large values instead of truncated previews - including for views, aggregations and tables without a primary key - adds the SQLX command line integration to Settings, and fixes table browsing and the KingbaseES procedure list.\n\n## Added (1)\n\n1. **SQLX command line integration**: install, update and locate the OtterMind SQLX CLI from Settings, import the connections Chat2DB already stores, and see the Skill command an agent needs; credentials go to the child process on stdin and are never written to disk, the renderer or the logs. by @openai0229 in #2959\n\n## Optimization (1)\n\n1. **Complete large values for view, copy and export**: JSON / LONGTEXT / BLOB values are completed from a snapshot captured while the query runs, so the grid, every copy format (cell, selection, `INSERT` / `UPDATE` / `WHERE`, IN Values, TSV, Markdown) and exports return the full content even when there is no primary key to re-query; the captured content is freed when the result is discarded or when it expires. by @openai0229 in #2972\n\n## Fixed (2)\n\n1. **KingbaseES procedure list**: procedures come from `sys_catalog.sys_proc` instead of the JDBC driver query that failed with `operator does not exist: boolean || oid`, covering V8R3 and V8R6+. by @openai0229 in #2956\n2. **Table data tabs no longer re-browse on every switch**: switching tabs no longer re-issues the request and resets to page 1, a failed first page offers a retry, and a layout change keeps the pane's active tab. by @openai0229 in #2961\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/OtterMind/Chat2DB/compare/v5.3.7...v5.3.8\n","mentions_count":1}
